purpose:
For temporary relief of: minor skin irritations associated with redness, itching, dryness and scaling; minor skin irritations, rashes, itching and redness due to eczema, insect bites, poison ivy, poison oak, poison sumac, contact dermatitis (e.g. caused by soaps, detergents, cosmetics and/or jewellery); seborrheic dermatitis, psoriasis; 
Anti-pruritic.
Anti-itch.
